  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kashkadarya Wastewater Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The provision of a sovereign loan of up to US$ 60 million (&#x20ac;53.5 million) to  the Republic of Uzbekistan for the benefit of the Limited Liability Company  Kashkadarya Suv Ta&apos;minoti, formerly known as the State Unitary Enterprise  Kashkadarya Suvokova (the &quot;Company&quot;) to finance the rehabilitation of  Kashkadarya Oblast&apos;s wastewater infrastructure (the &quot;Project&quot;).  The Project is expected to increase the number of people connected to the  wastewater network by 50,000, and the volume of wastewater treated to EU  standards by 13.7 million m3 per year.</narrative>
  </description>
